{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_014_vista3d-title\">VISTA3D</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">127 类自动分支、3D 点提示分支和 supervoxel 蒸馏共存的统一 3D segmentation FM。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unified 3D CT segmentation foundation model integrating a 127-class automated branch, a 3D point-prompt branch, and 2D supervoxel distillation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D CT 与可选点提示/目标类别</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D CT volume with optional 3D click coordinates or target anatomical class IDs</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">已知类别自动 mask 或提示条件下的 3D mask</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Automated 127-class 3D segmentation masks or interactive point-prompted 3D masks (including zero-shot novel structures)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/html/He_VISTA3D_A_Unified_Segmentation_Foundation_Model_For_3D_Medical_Imaging_CVPR_2025_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_014_vista3d')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_014_vista3d')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"VISTA3D original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/672617eff2831c1c504c.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_014_vista3d\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_014_vista3d')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_014_vista3d\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D CT</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D CT</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">体数据进入共享 3D 图像编码路径。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d ct volume with optional 3d click coordinates or target anatomical class ids and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"体数据进入共享 3D 图像编码路径。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d ct volume with optional 3d click coordinates or target anatomical class ids and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D CT\" data-node-name-en=\"3D CT\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D CT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">体数据进入共享 3D 图像编码路径。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d ct volume with optional 3d click coordinates or target anatomical class ids and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"提取多尺度体素特征与解剖先验。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 3D Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"3D Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Image Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">提取多尺度体素特征与解剖先验。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 3D Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"编码 127 个已知解剖类别，驱动自动分割分支。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Class Embedding within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Class Embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Class Embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Class Embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">编码 127 个已知解剖类别，驱动自动分割分支。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Class Embedding within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"正负点提示定义目标，并支持未见结构交互分割。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Point Prompt within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"3D Point Prompt\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Point Prompt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Point Prompt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">正负点提示定义目标，并支持未见结构交互分割。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Point Prompt within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"利用类别先验一次预测预定义解剖结构。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Automatic Head within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Automatic Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Automatic Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Automatic Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">利用类别先验一次预测预定义解剖结构。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Automatic Head within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把点嵌入与体特征融合，响应用户修正。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Point Head within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Point Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Point Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Point Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把点嵌入与体特征融合，响应用户修正。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Point Head within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以 3D supervoxel 组织区域，并蒸馏 2D foundation 特征以扩展结构知识。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Supervoxel Prior within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Supervoxel Prior\" data-node-name-en=\"Supervoxel Prior\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Supervoxel Prior</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以 3D supervoxel 组织区域，并蒸馏 2D foundation 特征以扩展结构知识。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Supervoxel Prior within the core unified 3d promptable segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"融合自动类别、提示和共享体特征，保持一个模型接口。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Unified Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Unified Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Unified Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Unified Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">融合自动类别、提示和共享体特征，保持一个模型接口。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Unified Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出自动、交互修正或提示条件下的新结构分割。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces automated 127-class 3d segmentation masks or interactive point-prompted 3d masks (including zero-shot novel structures) via 3D Masks.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"3D Masks\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Masks\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_014_vista3d', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Masks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出自动、交互修正或提示条件下的新结构分割。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces automated 127-class 3d segmentation masks or interactive point-prompted 3d masks (including zero-shot novel structures) via 3D Masks.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"VISTA3D Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 类别提示与点提示统一条件化三维分割</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Unified Class-Token and 3D Point-Prompt Conditioned Volumetric Decoding</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"VISTA3D：核心公式 · 类别提示与点提示统一条件化三维分割\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"14\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.783801pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" v