><use x=\"-5.191137\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g13-150\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"-.78106\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g13-52\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"3.981079\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-99\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"7.210173\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-108\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"9.231991\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-97\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"12.461085\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-115\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"15.290177\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-115\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"19.115489\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g7-185\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"22.941135\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g13-50\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"27.658448\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g7-186\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"31.474124\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g13-150\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"35.884201\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g13-52\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"40.64634\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-112\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"44.282705\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-111\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"47.91907\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-105\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"49.940888\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-110\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"53.577253\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g17-116\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"56.602558\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g7-185\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"61.045891\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g13-63\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"66.425716\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g7-186\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"70.440649\" xlink:href=\"#m014_g4-1\" y=\"-67.853049\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">自动模型难交互修正，2D SAM 对复杂 3D 解剖和标注流程不匹配</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Closed-set 3D models cannot interactively refine errors, whereas slice-wise 2D SAM loses 3D volumetric coherence.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">单一 3D 模型统一自动分割、点提示交互和提示条件下的新结构 zero-shot</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Unify automated multi-organ 3D segmentation, interactive 3D point prompting, and novel-structure zero-shot transfer in one 3D backbone.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">127 类自动分割、3D prompt 接口与 supervoxel 蒸馏的 2D foundation 特征</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Dual class/point prompt decoder coupled with 3D supervoxel feature distillation from 2D foundation models.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">面向 CT 的可复用 3D 标注与交互式修正接口</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Provides a versatile 3D CT annotation acceleration and interactive correction interface.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">代表 3D promptable segmentation 的实质进展，仍需前瞻跨机构验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Substantial step forward in 3D promptable segmentation; prospective multi-center workflow validation remains ongoing.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">自动类别分割与点提示交互共享同一个 3D 编码表示。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">类别 embedding 负责已知 anatomy，点 prompt 允许指定或修正实例。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">supervoxel 与 2D foundation 特征蒸馏把区域先验迁入原生体模型。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Unify automated multi-organ 3D segmentation, interactive 3D point prompting, and novel-structure zero-shot transfer in one 3D backbone.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Dual class/point prompt decoder coupled with 3D supervoxel feature distillation from 2D foundation models.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Unified Class-Token and 3D Point-Prompt Conditioned Volumetric Decoding.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合把批量自动分割与临床/标注人员的局部纠错放在同一接口。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">未见结构能力依赖提示且仍需跨机构前瞻验证，不能等同全自动 zero-shot。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Provides a versatile 3D CT annotation acceleration and interactive correction interface.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Substantial step forward in 3D promptable segmentation; prospective multi-center workflow validation remains ongoing.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/html/He_VISTA3D_A_Unified_Segmentation_Foundation_Model_For_3D_Medical_Imaging_CVPR_2025_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>VISTA3D: A Unified Segmentation Foundation Model for 3D Medical Imaging</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Project-MONAI/VISTA\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
